九月，齐侯亲自把姜氏送到讙，鲁桓公也到那里相会，姜氏随后进入鲁国。这场迎亲由大夫先行、两国国君会面和夫人入鲁等环节组成，体现婚姻与国家交往的结合。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前709年","end_year":-709,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-709},"title":"鲁公子翚前往齐国迎亲"},{"aliases":[],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["西亚"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-d0c5112d971fde0adbdeb965","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-d0c5112d971fde0adbdeb965","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-93e26f458d49c0db89baccfd","summary":"亚述方面攻占库穆胡城，并在当地任命一名行省总督；两项行动均见于同一年度条目。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前708年","end_year":-708,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-708},"title":"亚述攻占库穆胡并设置行省总督"},{"aliases":["夏，天王使宰渠伯糾來聘。","外交往来"],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["东周诸侯国"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-0737a090c6afcb264ae97d13","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[{"coordinates":null,"label":"鲁","precision":"historical_region","role":"political_region_context"}],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-0737a090c6afcb264ae97d13","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-483aba215fc7196de62f124c","summary":"鲁桓公四年夏，周天子派宰渠伯纠到鲁国聘问。《春秋》以天王遣使的方式记下这次来访，说明它属于王室与诸侯国之间的正式往来。《公羊传》把来使解释为天子的大夫，进一步称其为下大夫；这提供了理解使者身份的一种古代说法。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前708年","end_year":-708,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-708},"title":"周王遣宰渠伯纠聘鲁"},{"aliases":[],"body":[],"categories":["宗教"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["西亚"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-8e0eb5328b1be0e99f1c31f2","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-8e0eb5328b1be0e99f1c31f2","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-dc27fa50ce74e47c5c673657","summary":"杜尔沙鲁金的神像在塔什里图月进入各自神庙，编年史将这项宗教活动记在公元前707年。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前707年","end_year":-707,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-707},"title":"杜尔沙鲁金神像进入各自神庙"},{"aliases":["戰于繻葛","战争","周王室与诸侯"],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["东周诸侯国"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-8b660d7a85be6ba5e398018d","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[{"coordinates":null,"label":"繻葛","precision":"named_place","role":"event_location"}],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-8b660d7a85be6ba5e398018d","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-63e2fb0f30a8743ecd50758f","summary":"周桓王削去郑庄公的卿士职权后，郑庄公不再朝见，双方矛盾终于发展为战争。鲁桓公五年秋，周王联合蔡、卫、陈出兵伐郑，亲领中军，由虢公林父统右军、周公黑肩统左军。郑军据陈国内乱、军心不稳等情形拟定应对，分左右两拒配合中军迎战。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前707年","end_year":-707,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-707},"title":"繻葛之战：郑军击败周王军队"},{"aliases":["Dur-Sharrukin","都城","迁都"],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["亚述"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-21a421bf1903cd73b84d3e5f","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-21a421bf1903cd73b84d3e5f","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-b24d7dc6d3184458fbab47de","summary":"前706年，萨尔贡二世时期的亚述宫廷迁往杜尔沙鲁金；迁入时新城仍未完全建成。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前706年","end_year":-706,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-706},"title":"亚述宫廷迁往杜尔沙鲁金"},{"aliases":["秋，八月，壬午，大閱，蔡人殺陳佗。","军事制度"],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["东周诸侯国"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-5376cc069d703997bb4409f2","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[{"coordinates":null,"label":"鲁","precision":"historical_region","role":"political_region_context"}],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-5376cc069d703997bb4409f2","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-117cc1d5b9e1e01429b93878","summary":"鲁桓公六年秋，鲁国举行大阅。《左传》用检视车马解释这一活动，《公羊传》则说检阅车与徒卒，二者都将它理解为军事力量的检视，而非记录一次已经发生的对外战争。《春秋》特意列出此事，也使鲁国军备活动进入了逐年的政治记述。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前706年","end_year":-706,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-706},"title":"鲁国举行大阅"},{"aliases":["夏，穀伯綏來朝，鄧侯吾離來朝。","外交往来"],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["东周诸侯国"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-86c328baead70c1f97ce1e8d","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[{"coordinates":null,"label":"鲁","precision":"historical_region","role":"political_region_context"}],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-86c328baead70c1f97ce1e8d","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-d8d3423961488a5c82f8225c","summary":"鲁桓公七年，谷伯绥与邓侯吾离到鲁国朝见。《春秋》将两位来访国君分别具名记录，所说的来朝是从鲁国立场记诸侯赴鲁，与诸侯前往周王室的朝见不是同一对象。谷、邓两国在这段记载中以国名、爵称和人名同时出现，留下了一次较具体的诸侯交往记录。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前705年","end_year":-705,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-705},"title":"谷伯与邓侯来鲁朝见"},{"aliases":[],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["西亚"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-bcf6d4e8c2a654d3aa360d29","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-bcf6d4e8c2a654d3aa360d29","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-fb9639bb442d0b9962f4afad","summary":"亚述国王在战事中身亡后，辛那赫里布继承王位；编年史将这次继位记在阿布月十二日。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前705年","end_year":-705,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-705},"title":"辛那赫里布继承亚述王位"},{"aliases":[],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["西亚"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-04115c8da5cf69714c761930","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-04115c8da5cf69714c761930","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-7a4e8adcc73333101541e28a","summary":"亚述编年史记载基利济城的王宫在这一年修建完成；附近残缺文字没有提供更多建筑细节。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前704年","end_year":-704,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-704},"title":"基利济王宫建成"},{"aliases":["祭公來，遂逆王后于紀。","政治婚姻"],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["东周诸侯国"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-f0010f61d6f0b7cd24817fa8","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[{"coordinates":null,"label":"纪","precision":"named_place","role":"event_location"}],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-f0010f61d6f0b7cd24817fa8","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-ad59dd434f9661de6803f800","summary":"鲁桓公八年冬，祭公先到鲁国，随后前往纪国迎接周王的王后。《左传》把这项迎亲视为合礼，《春秋》则用先来鲁、遂往纪的连续记法，保存了使臣行程中的两个环节。纪国的女子后来进入周王室，说明王室婚姻也需要通过诸侯国及使臣之间的往来完成。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前704年","end_year":-704,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-704},"title":"祭公赴纪迎王后"},{"aliases":["九年，春，紀季姜歸於京師。","政治婚姻"],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["东周诸侯国"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-922eaf26fc902b0b6af03891","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[{"coordinates":null,"label":"京师","precision":"named_place","role":"event_location"}],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-922eaf26fc902b0b6af03891","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-f264993e42a5c96e3de5f4c2","summary":"鲁桓公九年春，纪季姜出嫁到周王所在的京师。她来自纪国，是前一年祭公赴纪迎接的王后，因而这条记载与先前的迎亲行动前后衔接。《春秋》以归字记录女子出嫁，也写明她从诸侯国进入王室这一婚姻去向。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前703年","end_year":-703,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-703},"title":"纪季姜出嫁周京师"},{"aliases":["冬，十有二月丙午，齊侯、衛侯、鄭伯來戰于郎。","战争"],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["东周诸侯国"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-371964f7edfacba36e4eda7e","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[{"coordinates":null,"label":"郎","precision":"named_place","role":"event_location"}],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-371964f7edfacba36e4eda7e","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-c86fe63cea39184b972d1574","summary":"鲁桓公十年冬，齐、卫、郑三国军队来到郎地与鲁国交战。《左传》把战事缘起追溯到此前援救齐国的行动：郑太子忽击败北戎立功，齐人供应诸侯军队时让鲁安排次序，鲁按周爵把郑列在后面，郑人因此发怒，后来向齐请兵，齐又联合卫军相助。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前702年","end_year":-702,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-702},"title":"齐卫郑与鲁战于郎"},{"aliases":["宋人執鄭祭仲。突歸於鄭。鄭忽出奔衛。","政权更替"],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["东周诸侯国"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-86d672aaaabb80190796b6a4","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[{"coordinates":null,"label":"郑","precision":"historical_region","role":"political_region_context"}],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-86d672aaaabb80190796b6a4","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-29b6cb035fa8b9388937585a","summary":"郑庄公去世后，祭仲拥立其子忽，即郑昭公。庄公另有一子突，其母雍姞出自宋国雍氏，雍氏在宋庄公处有势力。《左传》记，宋人诱捕祭仲，威胁他若不改立突就杀死他，同时又扣住突，索取财物；宋国由此直接介入了郑国的继承安排。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前701年","end_year":-701,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-701},"title":"宋扣留祭仲，郑突回国"},{"aliases":["Siege of Lachish","攻城","战争"],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["亚述","犹大"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-ce23ff71661a8bad908df208","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-ce23ff71661a8bad908df208","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-f626d4065fafe3ef01822240","summary":"前701年，新亚述帝国军队围攻并攻占拉吉；本条只收录城池攻陷这一具体行动及其年份。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前701年","end_year":-701,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-701},"title":"新亚述军队攻陷拉吉"}],"revision":"875f3aecb83cdabd51b4f61acfbead77c7fe6c856a325a8a9b4db47aa0454bb1","schema_version":"1.0.0","scope":"public_database","sources":[],"time_bounds":{"max_year":2026,"min_year":-10000}}